{"4684830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wildframe : A Creature Scrapbook", "steam_appid": 4684830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your grandfather dedicated his life to something most people dismissed as madness, photographing creatures that blur the line between the natural and the impossible. He never finished the work. Now the album is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WILDFRAME</strong> is a cosy wildlife photography game set in a world where nature has quietly gone extraordinary. Fill your scrapbook with photos of fantastical creatures, stamps, stickers, pressed leaves, and the small beautiful things that make a life's work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684830/extras/568cd5500517e789b6fd9f20ce95175d.avif?t=1781711356\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684830/extras_big/568cd5500517e789b6fd9f20ce95175d.avif?t=1781711356 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander at your own pace through lookout windows overlooking dense forests, high mountains, and other hidden corners of the world. Learn the habits of each creature. Find the right light, the right moment, the perfect angle, then shoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No danger. No timer. Just you, your camera, and a world full of wonders waiting to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted bestiary of fantastical creatures rooted in real wildlife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cosy, wholesome observation experience with no pressure or fail states</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully customisable scrapbook to make your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cameras, items, and upgrades to help track down the most elusive creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkroom minigames to process and develop your photos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and commissions from newspapers and wildlife associations</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your grandfather dedicated his life to something most people dismissed as madness, photographing creatures that blur the line between the natural and the impossible. He never finished the work. Now the album is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WILDFRAME</strong> is a cosy wildlife photography game set in a world where nature has quietly gone extraordinary. Fill your scrapbook with photos of fantastical creatures, stamps, stickers, pressed leaves, and the small beautiful things that make a life's work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684830/extras/568cd5500517e789b6fd9f20ce95175d.avif?t=1781711356\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684830/extras_big/568cd5500517e789b6fd9f20ce95175d.avif?t=1781711356 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander at your own pace through lookout windows overlooking dense forests, high mountains, and other hidden corners of the world. Learn the habits of each creature. Find the right light, the right moment, the perfect angle, then shoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No danger. No timer. Just you, your camera, and a world full of wonders waiting to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted bestiary of fantastical creatures rooted in real wildlife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cosy, wholesome observation experience with no pressure or fail states</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully customisable scrapbook to make your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cameras, items, and upgrades to help track down the most elusive creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkroom minigames to process and develop your photos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and commissions from newspapers and wildlife associations</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A cosy wildlife photography game set in a world of fantastical creatures. Observe, wait for the perfect moment, and photograph them all. Fill and customize your scrapbook at your own pace, and complete the collection your grandfather never could.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684830/aed2708c18d2c4778132c39ac7e3d3aa697536b2/header.jpg?t=1781711356", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684830/bae390c6f7a190c2f48add53f289e63d4d52bc00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781711356", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684830/bae390c6f7a190c2f48add53f289e63d4d52bc00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781711356", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 620 / NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</l